## Summary

- add the uppercase `KernelBackend.KDA` provenance backend for implementations produced by Kernel Design Agents;
- register the merged KDA-Pilot diffusion implementations as `KDA`:
  - #27392: native CUDA LayerNorm + scale/shift and residual + LayerNorm + scale/shift;
  - #29281: causal Conv3D cat-pad;
  - #29361: residual-gate add;
  - #29708: LTX2 QKNorm + split-RoPE;
- register the three FLUX.2 agent-produced implementations from #37162 as `KDA`:
  - LayerNorm + adaLN modulation + static FP8 quantization;
  - QK RMSNorm + RoPE + joint QKV packing;
  - token concatenation + static FP8 quantization;
- keep compiler choice and hardware eligibility orthogonal: KDA implementations may still use CUDA JIT, Triton, or CuTe DSL internally, while `CapabilityRequirement` gates supported devices;
